   "data": {
    "text": "EDITING & STRUCTURE\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 6, CC 97 to 112\n   1 Featured mains\n   2 Groups in the hour\n   3 Exit\n   4 How often a main is in the season\n   5 Scene change rate\n   6 Sequence lengths\n   7 How a scene begins\n   8 Transition\n   9 Call and response\n  10 Repetition scheme\n  11 Signature image\n  12 Contrast map\n  13 Tension\n  14 Energy\n  15 Visual density\n  16 Constant\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 7, CC 1 to 16\n   1 Psych-out shift\n   2 Cut articulation\n   3 Operator feel\n   4 Motif shape\n   5 Cross-cutting\n   6 Reveal timing\n   7 Story point of view\n   8 Scene length\n   9 suite: Two-person hour\n  10 suite: Build\n  11 suite: Drop\n  12 suite: Signature return\n  13 suite: Crime, Tarantino style\n  14 suite: Horror\n  15 suite: Action\n  16 suite: Western\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 7, CC 17 to 26\n   1 suite: Musical\n   2 suite: Documentary\n   3 suite: Surrealist\n   4 suite: Romantic comedy\n   5 pair: When tension peaks, a long silence\n   6 pair: When energy drops, the hold is long\n   7 pair: When suite Build, suite Drop\n   8 pair: When suite Aggressive camera, suite Quiet confession\n   9 pair: When suite Storm, suite Breathing room\n  10 pairs: Long-form shape"
